OL,3,GNEWSARiverside path plans approved
OL,4,Adespite moped worries
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been approved for the first
OL,7,Fphase of a one-mile (1.3km) riverside
OL,8,Fcycle and footpath which could cost
OL,9,F#8m.
OL,11,FThe shared-use path on the west bank of
OL,12,Fthe River Tawe will eventually connect
OL,13,Fthe Tawe bridges area with White Rock
OL,14,FBridge, linking Swansea with the former
OL,15,FHafod-Morfa Copperworks site and the
OL,16,Fstadium.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
