OL,3,GNEWSARiverside path plans approved
OL,4,Adespite moped worries
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about moped
OL,7,Friders potentially using the path and
OL,8,Fother anti-social behaviour, but an
OL,9,Fapplication by Swansea council to build
OL,10,Fa 325m section has been given the
OL,11,Fgo-ahead.
OL,13,FThe council's highways team said it
OL,14,Fwasn't possible to restrict access to
OL,15,Fthe shared-use path to prevent unlawful
OL,16,Fmoped use.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
